    <title>SQL：Json字段处理&#43;分布式ID生成</title>
    <link>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/sql-json%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86&#43;%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8Fid%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90/</link>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>Jinxiwei</author>
    <guid>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/sql-json%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86&#43;%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8Fid%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3 id="mysql-json-数据处理解析"><strong>MySQL JSON 数据处理解析</strong></h3>
<hr>
<p><strong>题目要求</strong>：
从 <code>products</code> 表的 <code>attributes</code>（JSON 字段）中提取 <code>color</code> 和 <code>size</code> 字段的值。</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="json-提取语法">JSON 提取语法</h2>
<p>在 MySQL 中，JSON 数据存储在 <code>JSON</code> 类型的列中，使用 <strong><code>-&gt;&gt;</code> 和 <code>-&gt;</code> 操作符</strong> 提取值：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>-&gt;</code>  返回 <strong>JSON 格式</strong> 的值（适用于嵌套查询）。</li>
<li><code>-&gt;&gt;</code> 返回 <strong>文本格式</strong> 的值（适用于字符串和数值查询）。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>查询示例：</strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> 
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    attributes<span style="color:#f92672">-&gt;&gt;</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;$.color&#39;</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">AS</span> color,
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    attributes<span style="color:#f92672">-&gt;&gt;</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;$.size&#39;</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">AS</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">size</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM</span> products;
</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>
<h2 id="示例数据">示例数据</h2>
<p>假设 <code>products</code> 表的结构如下：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">CREATE</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">TABLE</span> products (
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    id INT AUTO_INCREMENT <span style="color:#66d9ef">PRIMARY</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">KEY</span>,
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    name VARCHAR(<span style="color:#ae81ff">100</span>),
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    attributes JSON
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>);
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>表中的数据：</p>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th style="text-align: left">id</th>
          <th style="text-align: left">name</th>
          <th style="text-align: left">attributes</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left">1</td>
          <td style="text-align: left">T-shirt</td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>{&quot;color&quot;: &quot;red&quot;, &quot;size&quot;: &quot;M&quot;, &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Nike&quot;}</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left">2</td>
          <td style="text-align: left">Shoes</td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>{&quot;color&quot;: &quot;black&quot;, &quot;size&quot;: &quot;42&quot;, &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Adidas&quot;}</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left">3</td>
          <td style="text-align: left">Jacket</td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>{&quot;color&quot;: &quot;blue&quot;, &quot;size&quot;: &quot;L&quot;, &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Puma&quot;}</code></td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>执行 SQL：</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>python面试题1</title>
    <link>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Mar 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>Jinxiwei</author>
    <guid>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3 id="1python-中的三元表达式">1、Python 中的三元表达式</h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>[on_true] <span style="color:#66d9ef">if</span> [expression] <span style="color:#66d9ef">else</span> [on_false]
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li><code>[expression]</code> 是一个布尔表达式，结果为 <code>True</code> 或 <code>False</code>。</li>
<li>如果 <code>[expression]</code> 为 <code>True</code>，则整个表达式的结果是 <code>[on_true]</code>。</li>
<li>如果 <code>[expression]</code> 为 <code>False</code>，则整个表达式的结果是 <code>[on_false]</code>。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="例子">例子：</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>x <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">10</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>y <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">20</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 使用三元表达式选择较大的值</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>max_value <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> x <span style="color:#66d9ef">if</span> x <span style="color:#f92672">&gt;</span> y <span style="color:#66d9ef">else</span> y
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(max_value)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出: 20</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在这个例子中，<code>x &gt; y</code> 是 <code>False</code>，所以 <code>max_value</code> 被赋值为 <code>y</code>，即 <code>20</code>。</p>
<h3 id="2python-中如何实现多线程">2、Python 中如何实现多线程？</h3>
<p>Python 中的多线程可以通过 <code>threading</code> 模块来实现。线程是轻量级的进程，多线程允许程序同时执行多个任务。然而，由于 Python 的全局解释器锁（GIL），多线程在 CPU 密集型任务中并不能真正实现并行执行，但在 I/O 密集型任务中仍然有用。</p>
<h4 id="使用-threading-模块实现多线程">使用 <code>threading</code> 模块实现多线程</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#f92672">import</span> threading
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">print_numbers</span>():
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> i <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> range(<span style="color:#ae81ff">5</span>):
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        print(i)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">print_letters</span>():
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> letter <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> [<span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;a&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;b&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;c&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;d&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;e&#39;</span>]:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        print(letter)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 创建线程</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread1 <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> threading<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>Thread(target<span style="color:#f92672">=</span>print_numbers)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread2 <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> threading<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>Thread(target<span style="color:#f92672">=</span>print_letters)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 启动线程</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread1<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>start()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread2<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>start()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 等待线程完成</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread1<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>join()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread2<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>join()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;多线程执行完毕&#34;</span>)
</span></span></code></pre></div><ol>
<li>
<p><strong>GIL（全局解释器锁）</strong>：Python 的 GIL 确保同一时间只有一个线程执行 Python 字节码。这意味着即使在多核 CPU 上，Python 的多线程也不能真正并行执行 CPU 密集型任务。GIL 的存在是为了保护 Python 解释器的内部数据结构不被多个线程同时修改。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>SQL时间相关总结</title>
    <link>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/sql%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/</link>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>Jinxiwei</author>
    <guid>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/sql%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3 id="sql时间相关总结">SQL时间相关总结</h3>
<h3 id="1-常见时间类型">1. <strong>常见时间类型</strong></h3>
<p>数据库通常支持以下几种时间类型：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>DATE</strong>：仅存储日期，格式为 <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code>。</li>
<li><strong>TIME</strong>：仅存储时间，格式为 <code>HH:MM:SS</code>。</li>
<li><strong>DATETIME</strong> / <strong>TIMESTAMP</strong>：存储日期和时间，格式为 <code>YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS</code>。</li>
<li><strong>YEAR</strong>：仅存储年份。</li>
<li><strong>INTERVAL</strong>：表示时间间隔（如 <code>30 days</code>、<code>1 month</code> 等）。</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id="2-获取当前时间">2. <strong>获取当前时间</strong></h3>
<p>数据库提供了多种函数来获取当前时间：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong><code>CURRENT_DATE</code></strong>：返回当前日期（不包括时间）。
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_DATE</span>;  <span style="color:#75715e">-- 2023-10-05
</span></span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li><strong><code>CURRENT_TIME</code></strong>：返回当前时间（不包括日期）。
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_TIME</span>;  <span style="color:#75715e">-- 14:30:45
</span></span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li><strong><code>CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</code></strong> / <strong><code>NOW()</code></strong>：返回当前日期和时间。
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span>;  <span style="color:#75715e">-- 2023-10-05 14:30:45
</span></span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id="3-时间计算">3. <strong>时间计算</strong></h3>
<p>数据库支持对时间进行加减运算，常用的方式是使用 <code>INTERVAL</code>。</p>
<h4 id="示例-1加减天数">示例 1：加减天数</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_DATE</span> <span style="color:#f92672">+</span> INTERVAL <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;10 days&#39;</span>;  <span style="color:#75715e">-- 10 天后的日期
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"></span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_DATE</span> <span style="color:#f92672">-</span> INTERVAL <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;30 days&#39;</span>; <span style="color:#75715e">-- 30 天前的日期
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="示例-2加减月份">示例 2：加减月份</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_DATE</span> <span style="color:#f92672">+</span> INTERVAL <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;1 month&#39;</span>;  <span style="color:#75715e">-- 1 个月后的日期
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"></span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_DATE</span> <span style="color:#f92672">-</span> INTERVAL <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;3 months&#39;</span>; <span style="color:#75715e">-- 3 个月前的日期
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="示例-3加减时间">示例 3：加减时间</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_TIME</span> <span style="color:#f92672">+</span> INTERVAL <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;2 hours&#39;</span>;  <span style="color:#75715e">-- 2 小时后的时间
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"></span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">CURRENT_TIME</span> <span style="color:#f92672">-</span> INTERVAL <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;30 minutes&#39;</span>; <span style="color:#75715e">-- 30 分钟前的时间
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>
<h3 id="4-时间过滤">4. <strong>时间过滤</strong></h3>
<p>在查询中，经常需要根据时间范围过滤数据。例如：</p>]]></description>
